------------------------------------------------------------
MOBILITY MODEL ASSUMPTIONS
------------------------------------------------------------
- LOCAL decisions use a conventional coverage time of 300,000000 s.
- CLOUD decisions derive coverage and phi_link from the active radio access gateway.
- CLOUD_STABLE_PLACEHOLDER is not used in STRICT_GATEWAY mode.
- EDGE coverage uses current Euclidean distance, node radius and source speed.
- V2V coverage uses Euclidean distance and scalar relative speed abs(v_source - v_target).
- V2V heading and trajectory vectors are not modeled yet.
- Coverage estimates are clamped to 300,000000 s.

------------------------------------------------------------
COMMUNICATION LATENCY CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------
Lref: 1,000000 s
Aggregation rule: L(C) = sum_i L_i(C)
Partial upload rule: p * input / bandwidth
Partial download rule: output / bandwidth for every remote choice p > 0
Propagation delay rule: tau_n is included once as aggregated end-to-end delay

